BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Scituate Art Festival
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTSTAMP:20261003T145204Z
UID:79b4728723e69fc14ceeff860335@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Festival Update: Come celebrate the fall season by visiting us
  on the Village Green in North Scituate. Browse and buy original fine art
